{"nodes": [{"id": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame01701_frame", "label": "Frame 01701 - Infrared Overhead Broiler House View (Siren Camera, 2022-02-22 08:15:34)", "file_type": "image", "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame01701.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2022-02-22T08:15:34", "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Grayscale IR ceiling-mounted wide-angle capture of a commercial broiler house. A horizontal suspended feed line crosses the frame with five circular pan feeders; mid-growth birds form dense rosette clusters around each pan while the mid-floor stays comparatively empty. Serves as an unlabelled test-set frame for chicken detection / behaviour analysis."}, {"id": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame01701_overhead_cctv_viewpoint", "label": "Overhead Wide-Angle CCTV Viewpoint", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame01701.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every frame in the chunk shares one fixed ceiling-mounted wide-angle (barrel-distorted) camera geometry looking straight down on the litter floor. Birds appear as small top-down blobs with no visible head/tail cue in most cases, so behaviour must be read from position and posture rather than from facial or lateral body features. The barrel distortion also means apparent bird size varies with radial distance from the image centre."}, {"id": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame01701_pan_feeder_line", "label": "Suspended Pan Feeder Line", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame01701.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A single horizontal pipe carrying roughly five circular pan feeders bisects every frame. It is the dominant fixed landmark in the scene and functions as a stable spatial reference for registering frames from the same camera and for defining a feeding zone region of interest."}, {"id": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame01701_feeding_aggregation", "label": "Feeding Aggregation Around Pan Feeders", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame01701.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The most visually salient behaviour in the chunk: birds arrange themselves radially around each pan, heads inward, producing a flower/rosette signature. This pattern is what makes feeding behaviour detectable from an overhead view without any per-bird head annotation - the count of birds within a pan radius is a proxy for feeding activity."}, {"id": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame01701_infrared_night_vision_mode", "label": "Infrared Night-Vision Capture Mode", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame01701.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Three of the six frames (01701, 02201, 02901) are monochrome IR captures with low contrast between bird and litter, vignetting toward the frame edges, and no colour cue to separate the red feeder hardware from the birds. A detector trained only on colour frames would lose the feeder-colour prior in this mode."}, {"id": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame01701_timestamp_overlay", "label": "Burned-In Timestamp and Camera Label Overlay", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame01701.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Each frame carries a top-right date-time stamp and a top-left camera name ('1080P-IPC-Siren' / '1080P-IPC-Gas') burned into the pixels. This is free metadata that recovers capture date, time of day and camera identity for frames whose filenames only encode a frame index, but it is also a fixed high-contrast artefact that can bias a detector or a background model if not cropped or masked."}], "edges": [{"source": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame01701_frame", "target": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame01701_overhead_cctv_viewpoint", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame01701.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame01701_frame", "target": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame01701_pan_feeder_line", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame01701.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame01701_frame", "target": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame01701_feeding_aggregation", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame01701.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame01701_frame", "target": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame01701_infrared_night_vision_mode", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame01701.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame01701_frame", "target": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame01701_timestamp_overlay", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame01701.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame01701_feeding_aggregation", "target": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame01701_pan_feeder_line", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame01701.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame01701_frame", "target": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame02201_frame", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame01701.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame01701_timestamp_overlay", "target": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame02901_flock_growth_progression", "relation": "conceptually_relate